WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:07.376
These are the key contracts Scalar means one value
IN

00:00:07.403 --> 00:00:14.018
means membership EXISTS means existence ANY

00:00:14.045 --> 00:00:19.748
and ALL compare one value with a set Correlation
means the inner query

00:00:19.774 --> 00:00:25.351
depends on the current outer row A derived table
means the inner query

00:00:25.377 --> 00:00:31.063
produces rows for the outer query to use If you
understand the meaning

00:00:31.287 --> 00:00:33.340
you can rebuild the syntax when needed
